graph LR

  A["Prompt Engineering<br/>Manual process requiring skilled user<br/>(Cheapest, Simplest, and Least Powerful)"] --> B["Augmented Generation <br/>(RAG, KAG, GraphRag)<br>Add relevant context"]
  B --> C["Fine-Tuning<br>Train on labeled examples"]
  C --> D["Pretraining<br>Train from scratch<br/>(Most Expensive)"]
  C --> E["Agentic Behavior<br>Plan, act, use tools<br/>(Most System Complexity)"]

  %% Styling
  classDef step1 fill:#e6f2e6,stroke:#999999;
  classDef step2 fill:#d6eaff,stroke:#6666cc;
  classDef step3 fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#cc9900;
  classDef step4 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#cc0000;
  classDef step5 fill:#cc6666,stroke:#660000,color:#ffffff;

  class A step1
  class B step2
  class C step3
  class D step4
  class E step5
